    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032590/extras/d9c97d3f7943a7f22de77b6648688652.poster.avif?t=1722267754\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032590/extras/d9c97d3f7943a7f22de77b6648688652.webm?t=1722267754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032590/extras/d9c97d3f7943a7f22de77b6648688652.mp4?t=1722267754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Pixel Golf Club</strong> is an engaging arcade pixel golf game that immerses players in a beautifully crafted world of golfing greens. Combining nostalgic pixel art with modern gameplay, it offers a delightful visual treat and a deeply immersive experience.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pixel Art Aesthetics:</h2></strong> Stunning pixel graphics bring each golf course to life, enhancing the overall atmosphere and visual appeal.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing Gameplay:</h2></strong> Smooth and calming gameplay with serene soundscapes and ambient music provides a perfect escape.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Courses:</h2></strong> Uniquely designed courses with various obstacles and terrains test your precision and timing.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Development:</h2></strong> Hone your golfing skills by mastering different techniques and strategies.<br></li><li><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Experience:</h2></strong> Lose yourself in endless green expanses and discover the joy of hitting the perfect shot.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032590/extras/3a100fbc35512a956e6e478da8c26748.poster.avif?t=1722267754\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032590/extras/3a100fbc35512a956e6e478da8c26748.webm?t=1722267754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032590/extras/3a100fbc35512a956e6e478da8c26748.mp4?t=1722267754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
